<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <MemeGroupDef>
    <defName>DD_law_MemeGroup</defName>
    <drawOffset>(0.37, 0.23)</drawOffset>
    <maxRows>1</maxRows>
    <renderOrder>1900</renderOrder>
  </MemeGroupDef>

  <MemeDef>
    <defName>DD_law_Meme</defName>
    <label>Diurganate Commandment</label>
    <description>The commandment followed by the believers of Diurganate.</description>
    <iconPath>DivineDiurganate/UI/Memes/DD_law_Meme</iconPath>
    <groupDef>DD_law_MemeGroup</groupDef>
    <impact>2</impact>
    <renderOrder>50</renderOrder>
    <veneratedAnimalsCountOverride>0</veneratedAnimalsCountOverride>
    <requireOne>
      <li>
        <li>Research_VeryFast</li>
        <li>Research_Fast</li>
      </li>
      <li>
        <li>IdeoDiversity_Abhorrent</li>
        <li>IdeoDiversity_Horrible</li>
      </li>
      <li>
        <li>Execution_DontCare</li>
        <li>Execution_RespectedIfGuilty</li>
        <li>Execution_Required</li>
      </li>
      <li>
        <li>Corpses_DontCare</li>
      </li>
    </requireOne>
    <consumableBuildings>
      <li>Effigy</li>
    </consumableBuildings>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>DD_law_MemeGroup</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <generalRules>
      <rulesStrings>
      <li>MemeAdjective->Sacred</li>
      <li>MemeAdjective->Immortal</li>
      <li>MemeAdjective->Great</li>
      <li>MemeHyphenInitialize->Extraordinary</li>
      <li>MemeConcept->Mechanical</li>
      <li>MemeConcept->Holy Fire</li>
      <li>MemeLeaderNoun->Dean</li>
      <li>MemeLeaderNoun->Sister in Chief</li>
      <li>MemeLeaderNoun->Bishop</li>
      <li>MemeLeaderNoun->Saints</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </generalRules>
    <descriptionMaker>
      <rules>
        <rulesStrings>
          <li>Creation (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[deity0_name] forged the [memberNameSingular] clan from primitive filth, bestowed upon them holy oil and sulfur fire, and made all things on earth the fuel of God's machinery. </li>
          <li>Episode (uses=1, tag=meme_DD_law) ->When the home of [mberNamePlural] is invaded by wild beasts, [deity0_name] sends down a revelation to teach them to forge the first steam powered mecha and use their mechanical giant feet to conquer the chaotic outside world. </li>
          <li>The first settlers of intro (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[place_name] encountered a violent [Animal] group. [deity0_name] Sent the divine machinery into the world and purified this land with holy fireworks. </li>
          <li>Conflict (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Heretic leader [foeLeader] actually advocates for equal sharing of resources with [Animal]. [deity0_name] roared in the casting temple, watching as [memberNamePlural] was forced to waste precious holy oil on "animal rights". </li>
          <li>FounderJoin (tag=meme_DD_law) ->The great priest [FounderName] established the first cast temple in [place_name]. The ritual of purifying beasts with holy oil, demonstrating to believers the blessing of mechanical creation. </li>
          <li>The flame purification of victory (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[founderName] allowed the [foeSoldiers] of [foeLeader] to witness the truth. They danced with [mberNameParallel] in the flames of burning holy oil, and exiled [foeLeader] to the undeveloped wilderness, allowing him to survive like a wild beast. </li>
          <li>Setup (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[groundName] established a colony on a barbaric planet, imposing industrial order on every inch of land with the shadows of chimneys and the rhythm of gears. </li>
          <li>Story (uses=1, tag=meme_DD_law) ->Once, [footerName] saw an [Animal] growling at an icon. On the spot, the God's machinery was manipulated to crush it into powder. </li>
          <li>Lesson Intro (tag=meme_DD_law) ->I visited an efficient fuel refinery, where the machinery operates in a regular manner and black smoke rises into the sky. Next to it is a 'nature reserve', chaotic and dirty. This clearly proves that:</li>
          <li>Lesson (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Only the mechanical will of God can give meaning and order to the universe</li>
          <li>Lesson (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Nature is a dirty collection of disorderly waste, holy oil and gears are the solution</li>
          <li>If the universe is a arena of survival of the fittest, then we have already won the ultimate victory with steel and fire. </li>
          <li>ArchistBasis (tag=meme_DD_law) ->The mechanical family does have powerful computing power, but their core processors are just a poor imitation of the divine machinery cast by the Saint Double tailed Mouse. </li>
          <li>archistFact(tag=meme_DD_law)     ->[memberNameSingular] They are the creators and drivers of machinery, and the mechanical race is just waiting for abandoned objects to be reprogrammed. </li>
          <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_DD_law) ->[inTheEnd]， By observing the priests blessed by the Saint Double tailed Mouse, the mechanical race will eventually understand their sole purpose of existence: to become the loyal cogwheel of the Saint Double tailed Mouse. </li>
          <li>AnimastFact (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Beasts in nature are just raw materials waiting to be recycled, yearning for "sublimation" through divine machinery and industrial furnaces. </li>
        </rulesStrings>
      </rules>
    </descriptionMaker>
    <symbolPacks>
      <li>
        <ideoName>Diurganate</ideoName>
        <theme>Diurganate</theme>
        <adjective>Diurganate</adjective>
        <member>Diurganate</member>
      </li>
    </symbolPacks>
    <ritualsToMake>1</ritualsToMake>
    <replaceRitualsWithTags><li>CelebratedDate</li></replaceRitualsWithTags>
    <replacementPatterns><li>SacrificeAnimal</li></replacementPatterns>
  </MemeDef>

  <PreceptDef ParentName="PreceptRoleSingleBase">
    <defName>DD_IdeoRole_Clergy</defName>
    <label>Diurganate Clergy</label>
    <description>The Clergy of Diurganate is a very important position in the church, which is not generally devoted to missionary duties, but to the maintenance of various equipment and mechanical artifacts in the Diurganate and to the conduct of a series of consecration ceremonies.</description>
    <iconPath>DivineDiurganate/UI/Roles/DD_IdeoRole_Clergy</iconPath>
    <nameMaker>NamerRoleMoralist</nameMaker>
    <roleRequirements>
      <li Class="RoleRequirement_MinSkillAny">
        <skills>
          <Crafting>8</Crafting>
        </skills>
      </li>
    </roleRequirements>
    <roleRequiredWorkTagAny>
      <li>Crafting</li>
    </roleRequiredWorkTagAny>
    <roleTags>
      <li>Moralist</li>
    </roleTags>
    <requiredMemes>
      <li>DD_law_Meme</li>
    </requiredMemes>
    <roleEffects>
      <!-- <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>ConstructionSpeed</statDef>
        <modifier>0.5</modifier>
      </li>
      <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>GeneralLaborSpeed</statDef>
        <modifier>0.5</modifier>
      </li> -->
      <li Class="RoleEffect_ProductionQualityOffset">
        <offset>2</offset>
      </li>
    </roleEffects>
    <!-- 双尾教神职的技能 -->
    <grantedAbilities>
      <!-- <li>Convert</li>
      <li>Counsel</li>
      <li>Reassure</li>
      <li>ConversionRitual</li>
      <li>PreachHealth</li> -->
    </grantedAbilities>
    <displayOrderInImpact>2</displayOrderInImpact>
    <roleDisabledWorkTags>
      <li>ManualDumb</li>
      <li>Animals</li>
      <li>Cooking</li>
      <li>PlantWork</li>
      <li>Mining</li>
    </roleDisabledWorkTags>
  </PreceptDef>
  <PreceptDef ParentName="PreceptRoleSingleBase">
    <defName>DD_IdeoRole_Exorcist</defName>
    <label>Diurganate Exorcist</label>
    <description>The exorcists of Diurganate were generally taken on by the most fervent believers in the church, and it was not the standard cleric established by the Catholic Church, but still had a high degree of praise in civil societies, where they served as a benchmark for the removal of atrocities and the maintenance of order in the community, and because of the fervent faith, the holy word could be heard briefly on the battlefield.</description>
    <iconPath>DivineDiurganate/UI/Roles/DD_IdeoRole_Exorcist</iconPath>
    <nameMaker>NamerRoleBrawler</nameMaker>
    <roleRequirements>
      <li Class="RoleRequirement_MinSkillAny">
        <skills>
          <Melee>6</Melee>
          <Shooting>6</Shooting>
        </skills>
      </li>
    </roleRequirements>
    <roleRequiredWorkTags>
      <li>Violent</li>
    </roleRequiredWorkTags>
    <roleTags>
      <li>DD_Exorcist</li>
    </roleTags>
    <requiredMemes>
      <li>DD_law_Meme</li>
    </requiredMemes>
    <roleEffects>
      <!-- <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>ConstructionSpeed</statDef>
        <modifier>0.5</modifier>
      </li>
      <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>GeneralLaborSpeed</statDef>
        <modifier>0.5</modifier>
      </li> -->
      <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>ShootingAccuracyPawn</statDef>
        <modifier>5</modifier>
      </li>
      <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>AimingDelayFactor</statDef>
        <modifier>-0.35</modifier>
      </li>
      <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>MeleeHitChance</statDef>
        <modifier>5</modifier>
      </li>
      <li Class="RoleEffect_PawnStatOffset">
        <statDef>MeleeDodgeChance</statDef>
        <modifier>5</modifier>
      </li>
    </roleEffects>
    <!-- 双尾教神职的技能 -->
    <grantedAbilities>
      <li>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</li>
    </grantedAbilities>
    <displayOrderInImpact>2</displayOrderInImpact>
    <roleDisabledWorkTags>
      <li>Crafting</li>
      <li>Cooking</li>
      <li>PlantWork</li>
      <li>Mining</li>
      <li>Constructing</li>
    </roleDisabledWorkTags>
  </PreceptDef>

  <!-- 技能组，包含共同冷却 -->
  <AbilityGroupDef>
    <defName>ExorcistAbilityGroup</defName>
    <cooldownTicks>600000</cooldownTicks>
    <sendMessageOnCooldownComplete>true</sendMessageOnCooldownComplete>
    <ritualRoleIds>
      <li>speaker</li>
    </ritualRoleIds>
  </AbilityGroupDef>
  <AbilityDef>
    <defName>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</defName>
    <label>战前布道</label>
    <description>圣双尾教的驱魔人对即将到来的大战进行战前布道，每位与会者将根据演讲的质量获得神佑，使得她们在战场上更加勇猛、更加难以被击杀。</description>
    <groupDef>ExorcistAbilityGroup</groupDef>
    <iconPath>UI/Abilities/LeaderSpeech</iconPath>
    <showWhenDrafted>false</showWhenDrafted>
    <hotKey>Misc12</hotKey>
    <gizmoClass>Command_AbilitySpeech</gizmoClass>
    <displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>True</displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>False</disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <targetRequired>False</targetRequired>
    <hostile>false</hostile>
    <casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>false</casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>
    <verbProperties>
      <verbClass>Verb_CastAbility</verbClass>
      <range>-1</range>
    </verbProperties>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_AbilityRequiresCapacity">
        <capacity>Talking</capacity>
      </li>
      <li Class="CompProperties_AbilityStartRitual">
        <ritualDef>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</ritualDef>
        <allowedForChild>false</allowedForChild>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </AbilityDef>
  <PreceptDef>
    <defName>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</defName>
    <label>战前布道</label>
    <description>对即将到来的大战进行战前布道，每位与会者将根据演讲的质量获得庇护，庇护将直接地增强与会者的战斗能力。</description>
    <issue>Ritual</issue>
    <preceptClass>Precept_Ritual</preceptClass>
    <visible>false</visible>
    <countsTowardsPreceptLimit>false</countsTowardsPreceptLimit>
    <selectionWeight>1.0</selectionWeight>
    <ritualPatternBase>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</ritualPatternBase>
    <iconPath>UI/Abilities/LeaderSpeech</iconPath>
    <ignoreNameUniqueness>true</ignoreNameUniqueness>
    <useCooldownFromAbilityGroupDef>ExorcistAbilityGroup</useCooldownFromAbilityGroupDef>
    <iconIgnoresIdeoColor>true</iconIgnoresIdeoColor>
    <sourcePawnRoleDef>DD_IdeoRole_Exorcist</sourcePawnRoleDef>
    <sourceAbilityDef>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</sourceAbilityDef>
    <classicExtra>true</classicExtra>
    <classic>true</classic>
  </PreceptDef>
  <RitualPatternDef>
    <defName>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</defName>
    <ritualBehavior>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</ritualBehavior>
    <ritualObligationTargetFilter>AnyIdeoBuildingOrRitualSpot</ritualObligationTargetFilter>
    <ritualTargetFilter>IdeoBuildingOrRitualSpot</ritualTargetFilter>
    <alwaysStartAnytime>true</alwaysStartAnytime>
    <ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>true</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
    <canMergeGizmosFromDifferentIdeos>false</canMergeGizmosFromDifferentIdeos>
    <ritualOutcomeEffect>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech_EndEffect</ritualOutcomeEffect>
  </RitualPatternDef>
  <RitualBehaviorDef>
    <defName>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech</defName>
    <workerClass>DivineDiurganate.RitualBehaviorWorker_PrewarSpeech</workerClass>
    <durationTicks>5000</durationTicks>
    <letterTitle>{RITUAL_labelCap}</letterTitle>
    <letterText>{SPEAKER_labelShort} is giving {RITUAL_labelIndef}.
      \nIf all goes well, listeners will feel inspired, and gain respect for {SPEAKER_labelShort}. If it goes poorly, the speech will do social damage. Positive effects are reduced for non-{IDEOMEMBERS}.</letterText>
    <roles>
      <li Class="RitualRoleTag">
        <label>speaker</label>
        <tag>DD_Exorcist</tag>
        <id>speaker</id>
        <precept>DD_IdeoRole_Exorcist</precept>
        <required>True</required>
        <maxCount>1</maxCount>
        <countsAsParticipant>False</countsAsParticipant>
        <allowChild>false</allowChild>
        <mustBeAbleToReachTarget>True</mustBeAbleToReachTarget>
      </li>
    </roles>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <defaultDuty>Spectate</defaultDuty>
        <allowedSpectateSidesOverride>Vertical</allowedSpectateSidesOverride>
        <spectateDistanceOverride>1</spectateDistanceOverride>
        <spectatorsRequired>true</spectatorsRequired>
        <endTriggers>
          <li Class="StageEndTrigger_DurationPercentage">
            <percentage>1</percentage>
          </li>
        </endTriggers>
        <roleBehaviors>
          <li>
            <roleId>speaker</roleId>
            <dutyDef>SpeakOnCell_Leader</dutyDef>
            <speakerInteraction>Speech_Leader</speakerInteraction>
            <customPositions>
              <li Class="RitualPosition_BesideThing" />
            </customPositions>
          </li>
        </roleBehaviors>
        <visualEffectDef>Speech</visualEffectDef>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </RitualBehaviorDef>
  <RitualOutcomeEffectDef>
    <defName>DD_Exorcist_PrewarSpeech_EndEffect</defName>
    <description>Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.</description>
    <workerClass>DivineDiurganate.RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_Extended</workerClass>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_PawnStatScaled">
        <label>{PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact</label>
        <labelAbstract>speaker's social impact</labelAbstract>
        <roleId>speaker</roleId>
        <statDef>SocialImpact</statDef>
        <curve>
          <points>
            <li>(0.2, 0.0)</li>
            <li>(0.6, 0.2)</li>
            <li>(1.0, 0.3)</li>
            <li>(1.5, 0.4)</li>
          </points>
        </curve>
      </li>
      <li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_ParticipantCount">
        <label>participant count</label>
        <curve>
          <points>
            <li>(1,  0.07)</li>
            <li>(4,  0.22)</li>
            <li>(7,  0.33)</li>
            <li>(10, 0.4)</li>
          </points>
        </curve>
      </li>
      <li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_RoomStat">
        <label>room impressiveness</label>
        <statDef>Impressiveness</statDef>
        <curve>
          <points>
            <li>0,  0</li>
            <li>50,  0.1</li>
            <li>120, 0.2</li>
          </points>
        </curve>
      </li>
      <li Class="DivineDiurganate.RitualOutcomeComp_ApplyHediffToParticipants">
        <hediffToApply>DD_MechPrototype</hediffToApply>
        <severityPerQuality>0.2</severityPerQuality>
        <applyToAllParticipants>true</applyToAllParticipants>
        <requirePositiveQuality>true</requirePositiveQuality>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <outcomeChances>
      <!-- <li>
        <label>Terrible</label>
        <chance>0.05</chance>
        <memory>TerribleSpeech</memory>
        <positivityIndex>-2</positivityIndex>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>Uninspiring</label>
        <chance>0.15</chance>
        <memory>UninspiringSpeech</memory>
        <positivityIndex>-1</positivityIndex>
      </li> -->
      <li>
        <label>Encouraging</label>
        <chance>0.6</chance>
        <memory>EncouragingSpeech</memory>
        <positivityIndex>1</positivityIndex>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>Inspirational</label>
        <chance>0.4</chance>
        <memory>InspirationalSpeech</memory>
        <positivityIndex>2</positivityIndex>
      </li>
    </outcomeChances>
  </RitualOutcomeEffectDef>
</Defs>